Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:08.67,SevenCloudsIntro,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5}Ed Sheeran - Perfect (Lyrics)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:15.61,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I found a love for me,\NDarling, just dive right in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:19.08,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And follow my lead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:27.75,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Well, I found a girl,\NBeautiful and sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:35.61,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Oh, I never knew you were the someone\NWaiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.72,0:00:42.08,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}'Cause we were just kids\NWhen we fell in love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.43,0:00:54.68,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Not knowing what it was,\NI will not give you up this time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.14,0:01:03.82,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Darling, just kiss me slow,\NYour heart is all I own
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:10.29,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And in your eyes,\NYou're holding mine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.37,0:01:24.16,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:32.95,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.95,0:01:41.16,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}When you said you looked a mess,\NI whispered underneath my breath
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:50.40,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}But you heard it, darling,\NYou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:02:04.62,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Well, I found a woman,\NStronger than anyone I know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:12.95,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}She shares my dreams,\NI hope that someday I'll share her home
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.29,0:02:18.50,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I found a lover,\NTo carry more than just my secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.50,0:02:23.58,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}To carry love,\NTo carry children of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:34.34,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}We are still kids, but we're so in love\NFighting against all odds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.68,0:02:41.27,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I know we'll be alright this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.43,0:02:50.52,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Darling, just hold my hand,\NBe my girl, I'll be your man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:59.77,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I see my future in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:17.69,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:26.36,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.36,0:03:34.45,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}When I saw you in that dress,\NLooking so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:46.01,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I don't deserve this, darling,\NYou look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:04:10.29,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Baby, I'm dancing in the dark\NWith you between my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:19.19,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}Barefoot on the grass,\NListening to our favorite song
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:30.52,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}I have faith in what I see,\NNow I know I have met an angel in person
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:36.88,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}And she looks perfect,\NI don't deserve this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:44.39,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You look perfect tonight
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:05.20,SevenCloudsLyric,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8}You look perfect tonight
